# Broiler.VM ADR Index

Violates E4 twice: it links a record that does not exist, and it names an architecture rule with
no row in `rules.register.json`.

| ADR | Topic |
|---|---|
| [0013](0013-a-record-that-does-not-exist.md) | A record that does not exist |

Rule Z9: a rule identifier that was never registered.
